"069:005 68:5 O God, you know my foolishness; and my transgressions are not hidden from you.",
"069:006 68:6 Let not them that wait on you, O Lord of hosts, be ashamed on my account: let not them that seek you, be ashamed on my account, O God of Israel.",
"069:007 68:7 For I have suffered reproach for your sake; shame has covered my face.",
"069:008 68:8 I became strange to my brethren, and a stranger to my mother's children.",
"069:009 68:9 For the zeal of your house has eaten me up; and the reproaches of them that reproached you are fallen upon me.",
