"069:015 68:15 Let not the waterflood drown me, nor let the deep swallow me up; neither let the well shut its mouth upon me.",
"069:016 68:16 Hear me, O Lord; for your mercy is good: according to the multitude of your compassions look upon me.",
"069:017 68:17 And turn not away your face from your servant; for I am afflicted: hear me speedily.",
"069:018 68:18 Draw near to my soul and redeem it: deliver me because of my enemies.",
"069:019 68:19 For you know my reproach, and my shame, and my confusion; all that afflict me are before you.",
"069:020 68:20 My soul has waited for reproach and misery; and I waited for one to grieve with me, but there was none; and for one to comfort me, but I found none.",
"069:021 68:21 They gave me also gall for my food, and made me drink vinegar for my thirst.",
