"069:033 68:33 For the Lord hears the poor, and does not set at nothing his fettered ones.",
"069:034 68:34 Let the heavens and the earth raise him, the sea, and all things moving in them.",
"069:035 68:35 For God will save Sion, and the cities of Judea shall be built; and men shall dwell there, and inherit it.",
"069:036 68:36 And the seed of his servants shall possess it, and they that love his name shall dwell therein."
