"073:007 72:7 Their injustice shall go forth as out of fatness: they have fulfilled their intention.",
"073:008 72:8 They have taken counsel and spoken in wickedness: they have uttered unrighteousness loftily.",
"073:009 72:9 They have set their mouth against heaven, and their tongue has gone through upon the earth.",
"073:010 72:10 Therefore shall my people return hither: and full days shall be found with them.",
