"073:017 72:17 until I go into the sanctuary of God; and so understand the latter end.",
"073:018 72:18 Surely you have appointed judgements to them because of their crafty dealings: you have cast them down when they were lifted up.",
"073:019 72:19 How have they become desolate! suddenly they have failed: they have perished because of their iniquity.",
"073:020 72:20 As the dream of one awakening, O Lord, in your city you will despise their image.",
"073:021 72:21 For my heart has rejoiced, and my reins have been gladdened.",
"073:022 72:22 But I was vile and knew not: I became brutish before you.",
"073:023 72:23 Yet I am continually with you: you have holden my right hand.",
