"088:003 87:3 For my soul is filled with troubles, and my life has drawn near to Hades.",
"088:004 87:4 I have been reckoned with them that go down to the pit; I became as a man without help;",
"088:005 87:5 free amongst the dead, as the slain ones cast out, who sleep in the tomb; whom you remember no more; and they are rejected from your hand.",
"088:006 87:6 They laid me in the lowest pit, in dark places, and in the shadow of death.",
"088:007 87:7 Your wrath has pressed heavily upon me, and you have brought upon me all your billows. Pause.",
"088:008 87:8 You have removed my acquaintance far from me; they have made me an abomination to themselves; I have been delivered up, and have not gone forth.",
"088:009 87:9 My eyes are dimmed from poverty; but I cried to you, O Lord, all the day; I spread forth my hands to you.",
"088:010 87:10 Will you work wonders for the dead? or shall physicians raise them up, that they shall praise you?",
"088:011 87:11 Shall any one declare your mercy in the tomb? and your truth in destruction?",
"088:012 87:12 Shall your wonders be known in darkness? and your righteousness in a forgotten land?",
"088:013 87:13 But I cried to you, O Lord; and in the morning shall my prayer prevent you.",
"088:014 87:14 Therefore, O Lord, do you reject my prayer, and turn your face away from me?",
"088:015 87:15 I am poor and in troubles from my youth; and having been exalted, I was brought low and into despair.",
"088:016 87:16 Your wrath has passed over me; and your terrors have greatly disquieted me.",
"088:017 87:17 They compassed me like water; all the day they beset me together.",
"088:018 87:18 You have put far from me every friend, and my acquaintances because of my wretchedness."
