"089:014 88:14 Justice and judgement are the establishment of your throne: mercy and truth shall go before your face.",
"089:015 88:15 Blessed is the people that knows the joyful sound: they shall walk, O Lord, in the light of your countenance.",
"089:016 88:16 And in your name shall they rejoice all the day: and in your righteousness shall they be exalted.",
"089:017 88:17 For you are the boast of their strength; and in your good pleasure shall our horn be exalted,",
"089:018 88:18 for our help is of the Lord; and of the Holy One of Israel, our king.",
"089:019 88:19 Then you spoke in vision to your children, and said, I have laid help on a mighty one; I have exalted one chosen out of my people.",
"089:020 88:20 I have found David my servant; I have anointed him by my holy mercy.",
"089:021 88:21 For my hand shall support him; and my arm shall strengthen him.",
"089:022 88:22 The enemy shall have no advantage against him; and the son of transgression shall not hurt him again.",
"089:023 88:23 And I will hew down his foes before him, and put to flight those that hate him.",
"089:024 88:24 But my truth and my mercy shall be with him; and in my name shall his horn be exalted.",
"089:025 88:25 And I will set his hand in the sea, and his right hand in the rivers.",
"089:026 88:26 He shall call upon me, saying, You are my Father, my God, and the helper of my salvation.",
"089:027 88:27 And I will make him my firstborn, higher than the kings of the earth.",
"089:028 88:28 I will keep my mercy for him for ever, and my covenant shall be firm with him.",
"089:029 88:29 And I will establish his seed for ever and ever, and his throne as the days of heaven.",
"089:030 88:30 If his children should forsake my law, and walk not in my judgements;",
