"089:035 88:35 Once have I sworn by my holiness, that I will not lie to David.",
"089:036 88:36 His seed shall endure for ever, and his throne as the sun before me;",
"089:037 88:37 and as the moon that is established for ever, and as the faithful witness in heaven. Pause.",
"089:038 88:38 But you have cast off and set at nothing, you have rejected your anointed.",
