"110:002 109:2 The Lord shall send out a rod of power for you out of Sion: rule you in the midst of your enemies.",
"110:003 109:3 With you is dominion in the day of your power, in the splendours of your saints: I have begotten you from the womb before the morning.",
"110:004 109:4 The Lord swore, and will not repent, You are a priest for ever, after the order of Melchisedec.",
